        <section class="section section-about about-3 wow fadeInUp">
            <div class="container">
                <!-- S : 섹션 타이틀-->
                <div class="sec-tit">
                    <h2 class="tit wow fadeInLeft" data-wow-delay="0.3s">
                        국내최초 다자간 매매체결 회사, <br>
